{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/541215-2ed-games-taglines","id":541215,"title":"2ED games taglines","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-05T08:04:28-07:00","id":541215,"title":"2ED games taglines","content":"So we know that 2ED corebooks of <b>Vampire</b>, <b>Werewolf</b> and <b>Mage</b> have their own taglines, that were center to the setting changes brought with 2ED. The games have those sentances, that were also names for the books before they become official 2ED corebooks<br /> <br /> <b>Vampire: The Requiem</b> 2ED - &quot;<i>Blood and Smoke</i>&quot;<br /> <b>Werewolf: The Forsaken</b> 2ED - &quot;<i>The Wolf Must Hunt</i>&quot;<br /> <b>Mage: The Awakening</b> 2ED - &quot;<i>Addicted to Mysteries</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> Now, I make series of nWoD 2ED settings presentation for our RPG club, and run to this date with those taglines as titles for them. Only, as I know, when rest of annoucned corebooks come to development ( <b>Promethean</b> 2ED, <b>Changeling</b> 2ED ) I do not remember those phrases. Have they been putted to the fandom or public? Were they even made? Also, does other games with Storytelling System 2ED mechanics have them ( i.e. &quot;new&quot; games ) like <b>Demon: The Descent</b> or <b>Beast: The Primordial</b>?<br /> <br /> <b>If the all answers to above question are &quot;No&quot;, maybe fans have some cool taglines for them?</b> I look especially now in to <b>Beast </b>one, as I want to make a presentation about it in the few weeks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-05-2015, 11:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T08:17:34-07:00","id":541237,"title":"","content":"Actually, the original name for Mage was Mystery Play. Changeling's was Too Solid Flesh. Werewolf and Promethean never had one.<br /> <br /> And they weren't catchphrases.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T08:18:21-07:00","id":541239,"title":"","content":"I haven't seen any, but here are some I came up with:<ul><li>Beast: <i>One Big Scary Family</i></li> <li>Changeling: <i>Never Stop Running</i></li> <li>Demon: <i>Wheels Within Wheels</i></li> <li>Geist: <i>Death Is Not the End</i></li> <li>Hunter: <i>Do Not Go Gently</i></li> <li>Promethean: <i>Darkness Before the Dawn</i></li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T08:29:46-07:00","id":541266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/541215-2ed-games-taglines?p=541237#post541237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And they weren't catchphrases.</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe tagline is the word wyrdhampster was looking for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T08:32:19-07:00","id":541268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/541215-2ed-games-taglines?p=541266#post541266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=